              "id": "8add38a5-6825-4617-9797-99a22ddfe4b6",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "About Us\nMotoricBD is a motorcycle workshop providing motorcycle servicing, accessories installation, engine diagnostics, electrical repairs, premium bike care, and maintenance services.\n\nBusiness Hours\nWe are open every day from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM.\n\nShipping Policy\nOrders are processed within 24 hours. Delivery usually takes 2-5 business days. Customers receive a tracking number after shipment.\n\nReturn Policy\nProducts can be returned within 7 days of delivery if they are unused, undamaged, and in their original packaging. Customers must provide the purchase invoice.\n\nRefund Policy\nApproved refunds are processed within 5-7 business days. Shipping charges are non-refundable unless the wrong product was delivered.\n\nWarranty Policy\nElectrical products include a 30-day replacement warranty. Physical damage, water damage, and improper installation are not covered.\n\nPayment Methods\nWe accept Cash, bKash, Nagad, Rocket, Visa, MasterCard, and Bank Transfer.\n\nBooking Service\nCustomers can book motorcycle servicing online or by phone. Appointments are confirmed by email or phone call.\n\nService Packages\nRegular Service, Master Service, Premium Master Service.\n\nContact\nPhone: +8801717345856\nEmail: support@company.com\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\nQ: How long does servicing take?\nA: Usually 2-4 hours.\n\nQ: Can I cancel my booking?\nA: Yes, bookings can be cancelled before the scheduled service time.\n\nQ: Do you install accessories?\nA: Yes, we install headlights, fog lights, crash guards, mobile holders, and many other motorcycle accessories.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
